data: {"id": "a5c14d69f937442a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1647", "run_id": "a5c14d69f937442a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已获取的 Kubernetes 事实（Pod YAML/Describe/Events），**根因证据已足够明确**，无需再采集 Metrics/Logs/Tracing 即可定论。\n\n### 1. 身份与生命周期确认\n*   **实体身份**：Pod `workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` (Namespace: `aiops-case-10`)，UID: `f0496f24-4504-47ae-8b6d-685bd1536991`。\n*   **生命周期状态**：Pod 处于 **Running** 阶段（即 K8s 已调度且启动），但容器 `app` 处于 **CrashLoopBackOff** 状态。\n*   **启动与重启**：创建于 02:27:40，已重启 15 次。\n\n### 2. 候选原因排查与定性\n*   **直接原因（支持）**：\n    *   **Exit Code 137**：容器进程被强制终止（SIGKILL）。\n    *   **Liveness Probe 失败**：Events 显示在 Crash 前持续报 `HTTP pro", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789355290151, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a5c14d69f937442a-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "a5c14d69f937442a", "seq": 1648, "ts_ms": 1789355298239, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 65.161, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-10", "name": "workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/a5c14d69f937442a-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "099744493bd8d12fc80cacd94ffac9147e01089a387af8e742c401ed32dc6ac5", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "1842d706173ffabefd52c4e32766759cb474ea2a35604b8ec1a41a1b356b9716"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

