因。\n2.  **执行结果**：事实 #3 (Exit 137) 和事实 #4 (Killing) 证实了 kubelet 因探测失败执行了终止动作。\n3.  **状态一致性**：事实 #1 (K8s State) 和事实 #5 (Metric) 均一致确认当前状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n\n**证据局限性（关于 500 来源）：**\n现有证据（事实 #2）证明探针失败，但事实 #7 (Tracing) 显示业务流量访问相同 Pod IP (`172.16.104.34`) 的路径 `/work` 返回 `200`。这表明：\n*   Liveness Probe 可能配置了与业务访问不同的路径（如 `/health` 而非 `/work`），且该路径存在内部错误；\n*   或者探针触发时的应用内部状态与常规业务请求时的状态不同。\n但就故障表现（CrashLoopBackOff）而言，**Liveness Probe 返回 500 导致容器被杀**这一因果链已得到 K8s 事件和指标的直接证实。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 65.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r: 65.2s (Evidence 57.2s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 106.336, "metrics": {"run_id": "a5c14d69f937442a", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 106.34256625175476, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "wei